sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Server as MCP Server
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant Adapter as CRM Adapter
    participant CRM as CRM Database
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    User->>Agent: Get customer C001

    Agent->>Client: Discover available tools
    Client->>Server: tools/list
    Server-->>Client: Tool definitions

    Agent->>Client: Call get_customer(C001)
    Client->>Server: tools/call

    Server->>Policy: Validate identity and permissions

    alt Authorized
        Policy-->>Server: Allow
        Server->>Adapter: get_customer(C001)
        Adapter->>CRM: Query customer
        CRM-->>Adapter: Customer record
        Adapter-->>Server: Validated customer data
        Server->>Audit: Record successful operation
        Server-->>Client: Tool result
        Client-->>Agent: Customer data
        Agent-->>User: Customer information
    else Unauthorized
        Policy-->>Server: Deny
        Server->>Audit: Record denied operation
        Server-->>Client: Authorization error
        Client-->>Agent: Tool failure
        Agent-->>User: Access denied
    end
